# Line endings: store LF, check out LF on every platform. Without this a Windows
# clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every text file to CRLF and any later edit
# shows up as a whole-file diff. Binary assets are excluded from the conversion.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
